  "as_of_notes": "Latest monthly report available as of the research date (June 14, 2026). PDF titled 'Voter Registration by County \u2014 June 2026', prepared by the Elections Division on 6/3/2026; that preparation date is used as the 'as of' date. A July 2026 report was not yet published (URL returned a 404/SharePoint page). The same PDF contains a 'Comparison by County' page (totals) and a full party-breakdown page used here.",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "Source reports 12 party/registration categories: Democrat, Republican, Non-Affiliated, Constitution, Independent (Independent Party of Oregon), Libertarian, No Labels, Pacific Green, Progressive, We the People, Working Families, and Other. For this schema: Democratic=Democrat, Republican=Republican, Nonaffiliated=Non-Affiliated, IndependentParty=Independent (Independent Party of Oregon), and Other=sum of the remaining minor parties (Constitution, Libertarian, No Labels, Pacific Green, Progressive, We the People, Working Families, Other). All 36 counties included. County-level party columns sum exactly to the official statewide totals row and the county totals sum to 3,082,760. Note: Oregon's 'Independent' column is the Independent Party of Oregon (a recognized minor party), distinct from 'Non-Affiliated' (no party / unaffiliated)."
